main.dart<pre><code>import 'package:tts/request_info.dart';
import 'package:tts/tts.dart';

final tts = Tts(threadCount: 1);

await tts.loadIPAsMapping('assets/tts/en_tts_mapping.csv', language: 'en');

final ipas = tts.breakIPA('hɛloʊ wɝld');
final map = tts.search(ipas, language: 'en');
final inputIds = map['inputIds'] as List&lt;int&gt;;
final visemes = map['visemes'] as List&lt;String&gt;;

final request = RequestInfo(
  ['convnext-tts-en.onnx'],
  inputIds,
  visemes,
  'en',
  speaker: Speaker.us,
  speed: 0.82,
);

final output = await tts.speakText(request);
</code></pre> <p>The <code>output</code> value contains viseme timing data for animation workflows.</p> <p>For more control, generate voice audio and play it separately:</p> <pre><code>final durations = await tts.generateVoice(request);
await tts.playVoice(request);
</code></pre> <p>Dispose native resources when the plugin is no longer needed:</p> <pre><code>await tts.dispose();
</code></pre>
